WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,900
Sorry, girl, I scared you.

2
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:07,040
It's okay. I was too frightened.

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,240
I didn't even notice anyone approaching

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,820
Why play chess alone

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:14,220
My father taught me to play chess when I was a child

6
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:16,220
When I grow up, I will always correspond with my father.

7
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:19,020
Dad told me that life is like a game of chess

8
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:22,020
A lot of sacrifices are made for the sake of better enlightenment

9
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:24,300
But I can never see him again

10
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,810
I miss him today

11
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:32,080
Girl, can you play a game with me?

12
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,780
Then I’ll ask Mr.

13
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:37,640
The index manager of the base combat team

14
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,040
The only daughter died in the mouth of the bereaved

15
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,840
When I miss my daughter, I come here to play chess by myself

16
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,040
Finally got her
